      "description": "Eat out more often with the EatClub app. \n\n\nDiscover exclusive offers of up to 50% off the total bill including drinks, from great restaurants in your area. \n\n\n\nIt’s the perfect match! Restaurants post last-minute offers at days and times when they want extra customers, and you get to eat great food, try new restaurants and not break the bank doing it!\n\n\n\nTakeaway more with EatClub\n     •  Claim a takeaway offer in the EatClub app\n     •  Browse the online menu, with your offer automatically applied to every item\n\n     •  Place your order and pick the food up at your selected arrival time\n     •  Enjoy affordable takeaway, and support your local doing it\n\n\n\nDine-out with big savings off the total bill, including drinks\n     •  Claim a dine-in offer in the EatClub app\n     •  Arrive at your selected time and order directly with the venue\n\n\n\nIf the venue is on EatClub Pay (Melbourne, Sydney, Brisbane. Other cities are coming soon!)\nTap and pay your bill with your EatClub card and get your offer automatically deducted from the total bill. Staff won’t even know that you’re dining out on an offer.\n\n\nIf the venue is on our traditional voucher system\nOnce you’ve claimed your restaurant offer, you’ll receive a digital voucher to display when you arrive. \n\n\nFree to download, see what’s on offer right away!\nWhy not give it a go:\n     •  Discover amazing local restaurants across cuisines like Italian, Indian, Thai, Japanese and more\n     •  Enjoy a lifestyle of great food and wine in a way that’s affordable to you and sustainable to restaurants\n     •  Connect & support your local hospitality industry\n\n\nWe’re an Australian based startup on a mission to see a more vibrant hospitality industry for all. We have a dedicated development and support team in Australia continually looking for ways to build out great experiences for our customers and restaurants. \n\n\nDownload the app, and become a part of the EatClub family.\n\n\nCo-founded by celebrity chef, Marco Pierre-White.\nFacebook: www.facebook.com/EatClubApp/\nInstagram: @EatClubApp\nTwitter: @EatClubApp\n\n\nTerms of Use (EULA): https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/",
